#: ../../source/docs/common-rtk-correction.rst:5
#: 3730e025b2f349c086de8cc4fb443510 5d2e7affb9ee4043941cd90db8589ba7
#: 7ea0d73c43df485bb8ef6b2f47c18821 8f3297bf0fcc451faadc47cb62b3ccaf
#: da37223d8caa4fb78c8987d641cdfbcd
msgid "RTK GPS Correction (Fixed Baseline)"
msgstr "RTK GPS差分校正（固定基线）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rtk-correction.rst:7
#: 58f27e591e0e4c60980fca7a38901a2b
msgid ""
"It is possible to increase the normal position reporting accuracy of the GPS"
" using RTK (Real Time Kinematics). Normal GPS accuracy is 3-5 meters using "
"the Ublox M8N generation of GPS. If your global region has SBAS (Satelite "
"Based Augmentation Service) with geo-synchronous satellites reporting the "
"general propagation conditions and corrections to the GPS, then accuracy can"
" improve to the 1 meter range. But centimeter accuracy ranges can be "
"obtained by using Real Time Kinematics correctional data with the newer F9P "
"generation of GPSes."
msgstr ""
"可以使用RTK（实时动态定位）来提高GPS的正常定位精度。使用Ublox "
"M8N系列GPS的普通GPS精度为3-5米。如果您所在地区有SBAS（卫星增强服务），通过地球同步卫星报告一般传播条件并对GPS进行校正，则精度可提升至1米范围。但使用较新的F9P系列GPS和实时动态差分数据可获得厘米级精度。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rtk-correction.rst:11
#: 5484851f1f7a44328190a34cafc861ed 59bc1f679e144f6c8affdfa1d7e08527
#: 7749265e67c3476abd86bfc32ec82cf7 9bbc0fd119c048ada04f45facf2b3be3
#: 9ef1ec7f861d4cbc8cd9347c36d6b2dd
msgid ""
"Propagation and timing corrections (RTCM data) for each satellite can be fed"
" to the vehicle's RTK GPS in several ways:"
msgstr "每颗卫星的传播和时序校正数据（RTCM数据）可通过多种方式提供给飞行器的RTK GPS："

#: ../../source/docs/common-rtk-correction.rst:13
#: 35684fb6ab9444eeb84e9fe857910a0d 4bc33cd5704a4daf9cd52edcdee24f6b
#: 5eb016694f8247b593a7c3b93d082afe d6cc8846032c401bb23708eaa449d4e2
#: f680738026ec449e86e0496da9096354
msgid ""
"from a local RTK base station connected to the GCS, which is also connected "
"to the vehicle (via MAVLink)"
msgstr "从连接到GCS的本地RTK基站获取，该GCS也连接到飞行器（通过MAVLink）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rtk-correction.rst:14
#: 647a11ed9e694e1ca64c87d45aed3698 75f33557707e4250b0a8b932a0e298a6
#: 7b0e8091d75a4c28889a31f1545fdb34 a847b9b8283e4f2b9eecbfa257b10c75
#: fd5d909d83d341e885c296dec866d006
msgid ""
"by forwarding RTCM correction data from an NTRIP server via the internet-"
"connected GCS, which is also connected to the vehicle (via MAVLink)"
msgstr "通过联网的GCS从NTRIP服务器转发RTCM差分数据，该GCS也连接到飞行器（通过MAVLink）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rtk-correction.rst:15
#: 221a5c2634e14fd39becb53e519bf823 79bc5c2ffc114843b3252287e00635f0
#: 7f1fca0f04dc449a8303f7fe839f0ad6 911d008b9eef4cef9c75610f5b0fc4d0
#: b91897edf20e474e996c6167ed9ee5d2
msgid ""
"wirelessly from a local RTK base station directly to the vehicle GPS's "
"secondary UART port"
msgstr "从本地RTK基站无线直接传输到飞行器GPS的辅助UART端口"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rtk-correction.rst:20
#: 16b8396d341b47f8996983cd4fcee02f 6cd96196a06748ee8bfdb6ac932b19b3
#: 88d3596520e44adcb6e1e4260cf5030c ceff60a6aa4e4df08398c2d9f34decdc
#: db846f436ea043058b4a9faa69a91464
msgid "Method 1"
msgstr "方法一"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rtk-correction.rst:25
#: 247cb2764b9c49e7a593910e2c7e9342 388a1c25fd604a4ebddeeb1c0d966be1
#: ba2de8d56ddf4732bcad03301a2f8ba2 c8f0fc29211e49c1aebad9bd3c943f63
#: f3e8ab63986b45678bc523e53f116fd1
msgid ""
"Both Mission Planner and QGC allow the connection of an external RTK Base "
"GPS via USB. The correction data is passed from the Base unit through the "
"GCS program to the vehicle's MAVLink connection to the GCS, providing the "
"vehicle's RTK GPS with correction data to enable its position reporting to "
"become more accurate."
msgstr ""
"Mission "
"Planner和QGC均支持通过USB连接外部RTK基准GPS。差分数据从基准单元通过GCS程序传递到飞行器的MAVLink连接，从而为飞行器的RTK "
"GPS提供差分数据，提高其定位精度。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rtk-correction.rst:27
#: 1904967ef58b40629c787ca4826c1ff4 29c2d9ca40c74a49ab9e40fc62702541
#: 5b0e89c8379944298ef9d518689a6ed2 5cbc1d0ce1a340b1ada0b54da89ff51b
#: 70aec3d087df4e3c97ae3764a64d6a33
msgid ""
"Key to the success of this method requires that the RTK Base station's "
"position be precisely known or determined. Usually, this requires that the "
"GCS command the RTK Base GPS to \"survey-in\" itself. The GPS takes many "
"measurements determining its mean location, applying interim corrections, "
"and continues to refine its location deviations until the measurements are "
"within a set threshold of error (usually a few meters) for a given time "
"period (usually 60 seconds). The GPS then uses that as its location and "
"start outputting the correction data to the GCS for forwarding to the "
"vehicle's GPS."
msgstr ""
"该方法成功的关键在于RTK基站的位置必须精确已知或已确定。通常，这需要GCS命令RTK基准GPS进行「自勘测」。GPS进行多次测量确定其平均位置，应用临时校正，持续细化其位置偏差，直到测量值在设定误差阈值（通常为几米）内持续一定时间（通常60秒）。然后GPS使用该位置作为其坐标，并开始向GCS输出差分数据以转发给飞行器GPS。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rtk-correction.rst:29
#: 3ba74321bb774c3d8ab345ff0b09de76 5d18f4c9b93347afa117d571d3b4c920
#: 6690718e218d49afb4269f3a19a419ec 7c3d39c53ad643c09f34fd79dff098f1
#: e86f2be3c7f94716a50b4e1a0e5dd99f
msgid ""
"It is possible to program the RTK Base's exact location directly into it if "
"it is known using the UBlox programming tool or Mission Planner if that "
"location has been previously \"surveyed-in\"."
msgstr ""
"如果RTK基准位置已知，可以使用UBlox编程工具或Mission Planner将精确位置直接编程到设备中（前提是该位置已经过「勘测」）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rtk-correction.rst:32
#: ../../source/docs/common-rtk-correction.rst:64
#: ../../source/docs/common-rtk-correction.rst:92
#: 04582ee0b8cf4d16be1743cdc92da98d 14457225d59b44e0ab27e9e2f427c3c1
#: 1a5aa223081946d8b13c732fec0d5896 231783d0749649ffa2ec3eae51364fff
#: 2701b2d170cd434ebe30eb2b61b7798f 2c92c592180948bab588e11211efcb76
#: 2ebde12cd64242cc9ff5c8b457b3e0ea 69e1be83454f4b3ebbff373fb0490107
#: 746efa88b4834b30a458af6d80ba3718 85b7db0c04394c5dbcb7926b256eff11
#: 9a9831dd534e4a50a49eab8952ff53e2 a2f3b0fe4c004c6bbfc2f2e7b94e92e1
#: ab32c313807741989e13c0f8ac3fd7a5 d697f86639344a55864cb3773dde72cd
#: e9e2babb724a42dc9e8b302ba50549d2
msgid "Setup"
msgstr "设置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rtk-correction.rst:34
#: 0fb96a9388184dd6b36ddfec14bca6c8 6509e74c2b6348e995d568d7da52f02c
#: 8facaedc05834479bd20d003b9a4fb81 ce0bcb9ad3264a379cc847387d820aaf
#: d9d4f4d723ab4ed4a973dc4f5d289232
msgid ""
"Vehicle: normal setup for serial GPS (:ref:`GPS1_TYPE<GPS1_TYPE>` = 1) or "
"DroneCAN GPS (:ref:`GPS1_TYPE<GPS1_TYPE>` = 9)"
msgstr ""
"飞行器：串行GPS的常规设置（:ref:`GPS1_TYPE<GPS1_TYPE>` = 1）或DroneCAN "
"GPS（:ref:`GPS1_TYPE<GPS1_TYPE>` = 9）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rtk-correction.rst:36
#: 10ade2d1fb714f13a5d58eaaf7a546a6 34af4ca2cb1d473193ace2cbb6b0533b
#: 571afe6f34a546beab20777c5eda0ba3 9a0c8442e9874810a27d0e0617f892ff
#: a834e7d07fd846e18a7a2c459e3a92f7
msgid "Attach RTK GPS via USB to PC running Mission Planner or QGC."
msgstr "通过USB将RTK GPS连接到运行Mission Planner或QGC的PC。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rtk-correction.rst:38
#: 05eeacf766b74946afa02cd28aa79e14 1bcc6a2e00f5472faf9a8a254975d781
#: 55468a252097424ba42135d0758d8278 a8b6c3f6ed8a44bfb60ba4e1f4ad3f8f
#: f2235d76f32f495f8b11f7a8fffbe732
msgid "You first must \"survey-in\" the GPS, in Mission Planner."
msgstr "首先需要在Mission Planner中对GPS进行「勘测」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rtk-correction.rst:42
#: 3f40338c608d41698c8689dade102aaf 50ac28ec45a8472e84761136ebe43f1d
#: 8f7f857b5cfd4b65b72f2b2aae403ccc d030ad4938e74899b33f7eb6fc6a1d3f
#: e2e8428df8954380aabd5e971b0491a3
msgid ""
"After the GPS is attached to the PC, start Mission Planner, enter the COM "
"port to which it is attached and press \"Connect\". The \"Link Status\" "
"should start showing data being input and the satellite constellations "
"locked will be shown with green indicators."
msgstr ""
"将GPS连接到PC后，启动Mission Planner，输入连接的COM端口并按「Connect」。「Link "
"Status」应开始显示输入的数据，锁定的卫星星座将以绿色指示灯显示。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rtk-correction.rst:46
#: 3f47a446eaa34c0797ba596c86d2e546 4636328a3d22439495b6d4d7d4e152c0
#: a4f74dde00ef410cbb7dcb385438b903 b0f15a4ad20444ae85954c5dc2af8f3b
#: e2abf533f31e491898c7a2401aca8fe1
msgid ""
"Then press the \"RESTART\" button (#1 in the picture) to start the \"survey-"
"in\" process using the SurveyIn Acc(m) and Time(s). Ublox recommends a "
"SurveyIn ACC of 5m or less. 2m is commonly used. In #2. in the picture the "
"survey status progress can be monitored until a \"Position is Valid\" is "
"obtained."
msgstr ""
"然后按「RESTART」按钮（图中#1）开始使用SurveyIn Acc(m)和Time(s)进行「勘测」过程。Ublox建议SurveyIn "
"ACC为5米或更小，通常使用2米。在图中#2处可监测勘测状态进度，直到获得「Position is Valid」（位置有效）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rtk-correction.rst:48
#: 3a8a4fd3435e4160ba249c8d63edea9b 53020e001e824b4e874b9f48a530c6c4
#: 789ededecd894bf684bfa3cc453936a0 aec47d03f08e440aba4299193ecdc1b2
#: bdf7c49a363846678469daeb0b3f890e
msgid ""
"Once the position is obtained, you can save it in a list for future use, if "
"the Base is placed at that exact location in the future, to avoid another "
"survey procedure. To use an existing position, first ensure that the GPS "
"attached to the Mission Planner PC is indeed in that exact location, then "
"press the \"USE\" button for that location in the list. RTK updates to the "
"vehicle will begin immediately."
msgstr ""
"获得位置后，可将其保存在列表中供将来使用——若基站以后放置在该精确位置，可避免再次勘测。使用已有位置时，首先确认连接Mission Planner "
"PC的GPS确实处于该精确位置，然后按列表中该位置的「USE」按钮。RTK更新将立即开始向飞行器发送。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rtk-correction.rst:50
#: 0af17acb72c847ae98b116e5f4f23cfb 267fa47e9dc64cc6b3453691915259c6
#: 7c448d6d65f64773b711fb5ad06e7eaf 91fa06bc8a5546febe9a395ab75e8a73
#: a51de040cbcb4cf08e9c131600767d7a
msgid ""
"Once RTK data is being processed by the vehicle's GPS, its status will "
"change to \"RTK float\" and then to \"RTK fixed\" in the GCS HUD indicating "
"that it is ready for use. \"RTK float\" means that it is using correction "
"data, but has not moved to the highest precision mode yet."
msgstr ""
"飞行器GPS开始处理RTK数据后，GCS HUD中其状态将从「RTK float」变为「RTK fixed」，表示已准备好使用。「RTK "
"float」表示正在使用差分数据，但尚未进入最高精度模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rtk-correction.rst:53
#: 9bbfb61e105a4887a08005dd61bc92a4 a2dea09496214d8e935e173bef79c38c
#: af195585fbfb4e16b10612bf221d7c27 ba6e7192b2c4423c837626c897d5b2bb
#: faf67c203882443cb1eb6ac360510388
msgid "Method 2"
msgstr "方法二"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rtk-correction.rst:57
#: 37e480703fc0455dabfab88f68249883 5c126050ed7848faab4b4594fef1faf5
#: aba66734bb1f45b9ade138320a06629c d7816a6d016b4a5480010aa40f84bf55
#: f38df7a5324149848f0583ef7b8e4fdf
msgid ""
"There are internet-based services that can provide correction data from "
"bases linked to that service. They provide the correction data over the "
"internet via the NTRIP protocol. Mission Planner and QGC can connect to "
"these servers and forward the data via MAVLink connection to the vehicle."
msgstr ""
"有些互联网服务可从连接到该服务的基站提供差分数据，通过NTRIP协议在互联网上提供差分数据。Mission "
"Planner和QGC可连接到这些服务器，并通过MAVLink将数据转发给飞行器。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rtk-correction.rst:59
#: 4dfe5a8632f640f389a8572497b74847 60392bd120204acd9fb8fee566551647
#: 729454b123764115919a9db227d8a978 7dc9996694ff443c8f2f0d0501190aa0
#: b24f00c95c844e58ad5e14e04e2d67d0
msgid ""
"If the service has a Base station providing real-time correction data within"
" 100 Km or so of the vehicle's location, then it will usually be "
"satisfactory. For every 10 Km away from the vehicle that the source is "
"located, the inaccuracy limits will increase ~ 1-1.5cm. Some services "
"provide interpolated data for any location within their network of stations "
"and this can sometimes be successfully used if a station is further than "
"100km away from the vehicle location."
msgstr ""
"如果该服务在飞行器位置100公里范围内有提供实时差分数据的基站，通常效果令人满意。基站每距飞行器10公里，精度限制将增加约1-1.5厘米。某些服务为其站网内的任意位置提供插值数据，如果站点距飞行器位置超过100公里，有时也可成功使用。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rtk-correction.rst:61
#: 31f1b1727b574be88f5a390347d990af 597a1586f1b54954a4c452b25ff24710
#: 62488b977b714e86ad1667840603783c e23f269adf2e40ef9893f14ff01716ca
#: ed4050f22c7340b5bb588e514561749e
msgid "Some of these services are free and some are fee-based."
msgstr "其中一些服务是免费的，一些是收费的。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rtk-correction.rst:66
#: 0fb1d39ff30b4b87a79dd0712a3d9d5e 155e675d65884e7aa153ca1a7abe3263
#: 360ff21bf4c643f5a3d83042e6680129 7a2e6ec2ad8c431e81d68784b99d9ea1
#: d5f0745661fc470ca560170200bcfe8b
msgid ""
"First, be sure that the vehicle is connected to the GCS and has a *GPS 3D "
"lock*. Then on the GCS:"
msgstr "首先，确保飞行器已连接到GCS并具有 *GPS 3D锁定*。然后在GCS上："

#: ../../source/docs/common-rtk-correction.rst:70
#: 136ae8acd8054ca9891723cb4daebfa5 2e05833fb22046bfb94fbd0be1406ad0
#: 38d8cee721644f61b776d5ab4c462dc1 3f9bb4c7ae414184aeea8940f57a2d4f
#: b927d9ffcbc14713bbd022ddd4ab1e4f
msgid ""
"Select \"NTRIP\" from the dropdown box and press \"Connect\". A dialog box "
"(#2.) will appear to enter the login information for an NTRIP server."
msgstr "从下拉框选择「NTRIP」并按「Connect」。将出现对话框（#2.）以输入NTRIP服务器的登录信息。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rtk-correction.rst:71
#: 004a57eb56e0423a950056eca41c75f5 2cba231c4a69437aa55cdfa1651849a4
#: 80c071717975493ea2b8fde6512f6263 e34844cce1234b08888575fec071039b
#: ef07ac9208fa4cfd99821520246a7843
msgid "The login is usually of the form:"
msgstr "登录通常格式如下："

#: ../../source/docs/common-rtk-correction.rst:78
#: 0558f87a0ac94d2d8ff127ec8b013e65 2c62d1298fd849d2ab944cf595221f5c
#: 6a38d966bcaa4fa08295e146aa40f219 9fdb308c8e4144bd9d4e64d5bef702ee
#: b1c637ffde54405cb35ed858ccf81f1c
msgid ""
"where the \"host\" is the NTRIP server URL, the port as designated by the "
"service (usually 2101 for RTCM3.1 data streams), and the mount point will be"
" the service's designation of the station that you want to use (the closest "
"one to your location), usually something like \"P807_RTCM\" or "
"\"Evermount234\", whatever the service names them."
msgstr ""
"其中「host」为NTRIP服务器URL，端口由服务指定（RTCM3.1数据流通常为2101），挂载点为服务对您要使用的站点（最靠近您位置的站点）的名称，通常类似「P807_RTCM」或「Evermount234」，取决于服务的命名方式。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rtk-correction.rst:80
#: 2208b7652e7242198af2d84bcd4f6d97 39ba3e8e606b4c72b9717f22089d4bc1
#: 56e4a2d87afc4c02a12af70bda6f1c88 abd249127efb4a0faecc089aaec0eafd
#: f3493daaf18a4e3db51059593f14bbf5
msgid ""
"If the connection occurs, data will start appearing in the Link Status box "
"at the top and be sent to the connected vehicle's RTK GPS."
msgstr "连接成功后，数据将开始出现在顶部的Link Status框中，并发送到已连接飞行器的RTK GPS。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rtk-correction.rst:83
#: 932f6fa69efe4c7e8d07e289ba53236f a6ed596d6a154e6ba3cee1314524de12
#: c2da2e1bd5f242a1905b0ccc42fdb4ff cd35bbef5b1c4ecdb82cfc0c56fa4cf3
#: f1c42dcd8ef24ba4807289211847b475
msgid "Method 3"
msgstr "方法三"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rtk-correction.rst:87
#: 03a0b4fb3f9d490e9fc0a29840e0c568 7151b46a48424e468f752e79357008fc
#: a798b33c66b74f48b5b2930c7b557de6 afff5255016d44ff9704b5c6bc2e9c9b
#: b423e862a06249eb937622778f962fdb
msgid ""
"It is possible to program the GPS used as a Fixed Base, to automatically "
"begin to *survey-in* itself upon power up and start sending RTCM correction "
"data out its UART2 port once completed. By attaching a transparent RF modem,"
" either radio-based or WIFI, you can directly transmit the correction data "
"to the vehicle's UART2 port."
msgstr ""
"可以将用作固定基站的GPS编程为上电后自动开始 "
"*自勘测*，完成后从其UART2端口发送RTCM差分数据。通过连接透明射频调制解调器（无线电或WIFI），可以直接将差分数据传输到飞行器的UART2端口。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rtk-correction.rst:89
#: 2a22ffa42dd64d889bb3470782a17cd6 5d1e773cb5214ffcb7fdbcec61c95a2c
#: 5dbc2d211e0340cfbbb6f684210e725c 760ae15f4a45465a8a57e71c9a705c56
#: 8d121e96a3674a1088af12de6b6098dc
msgid ""
"This requires configuring the Base RTK GPS with the UBlox configuration "
"tool. See `Sparkfun's tutorial "
"<https://learn.sparkfun.com/tutorials/setting-up-a-rover-base-rtk-system>`__"
" for more information."
msgstr ""
"这需要使用UBlox配置工具配置基准RTK GPS。更多信息请参阅 `Sparkfun教程 "
"<https://learn.sparkfun.com/tutorials/setting-up-a-rover-base-rtk-"
"system>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rtk-correction.rst:94
