#: ../../source/docs/common-rtk-correction.rst:103
#: 09809343658e4fb4855386df5c818292 354f2cc1e6f34c2392546f06adb2ca15
#: 59cda2cc02614e77b480d0abc66b7be1 65c65f0543e84c99b20e445c6e7f94f6
#: 81f7fffea9f7493caeb0231ecc772377
msgid ""
"Normally, only a single source of RTCM messages is provided to the autopilot"
" and the RTCM messages are NOT fully parsed, only extracting the normally "
"required information to be forwarded to the GPS for RTK corrections.If "
"multiple sources of correction data are received by the autopilot, full "
"parsing of the RTCM messages is done automatically and all RTCN message data"
" sent to the GPS to provide multiple correction sources to be applied to the"
" GPS position. This \"full parsing\" of RTCM messages also provides "
"additional logged data which may be helpful in diagnosing RTK problems even "
"with a single RTCM data source. Setting "
":ref:`GPS_DRV_OPTIONS<GPS_DRV_OPTIONS>` bit 6 high, will enable this "
"extended parsing and logging for diagnosing RTK issues by a skilled "
"development team member from the log."
msgstr ""
"通常，飞控只接收单一RTCM消息来源，RTCM消息不进行完整解析，只提取通常所需的信息并转发给GPS进行RTK差分。如果飞控接收到多个差分数据来源，则自动对RTCM消息进行完整解析，并将所有RTCM消息数据发送给GPS，以提供多个差分来源对GPS位置进行修正。这种RTCM消息「完整解析」还会提供额外的记录数据，即使使用单一RTCM数据来源，也有助于诊断RTK问题。将"
" :ref:`GPS_DRV_OPTIONS<GPS_DRV_OPTIONS>` "
"的第6位置高，将为熟练的开发团队成员启用此扩展解析和日志记录，以便通过日志诊断RTK问题。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rtk-correction.rst:105
#: 0909d990b47c43f7b02b86144cbb35cf 52b417a2acfb492b93372391c671a78b
#: 58740d4de3ad4a15be757ae595152041 b538e42d16284a15958795034e583944
#: d41f8124356f49d98992ccfebde7d9ee
msgid ""
"In some cases, specialized custom GPS commands using the RTCM message "
"framework may be used in some systems and full parsing may result in "
"problems with the GPS. Setting bit 7 of "
":ref:`GPS_DRV_OPTIONS<GPS_DRV_OPTIONS>` disables the automatic full parsing "
"with multiple RTCM data sources being sent to the autopilot if this is "
"causing a problem"
msgstr ""
"在某些情况下，某些系统可能使用基于RTCM消息框架的专用自定义GPS命令，完整解析可能导致GPS出现问题。如果向飞控发送多个RTCM数据来源时出现此问题，将"
" :ref:`GPS_DRV_OPTIONS<GPS_DRV_OPTIONS>` 的第7位置高可禁用自动完整解析。"

